{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNiOFiyq7hdtqaQaTRS2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to build the four SHOP.CO retail pages in Figma by working through what remains after the brief, foundations, components, media metadata and node styles are already in hand. The fonts are confirmed: \"Archivo Black | Regular\" and the Plus Jakarta Sans weights. The media assets are COMPONENTs with IMAGE fills on another page of the same file, and cross-page instances are legal in Figma, so reuse is available.\n\nWhat is left is not external information. The image assets are reachable through their existing fills, so I read each asset's imageHash off the media components and set it directly as an IMAGE fill with scaleMode FILL on new rectangles; that sidesteps instancing entirely and lets one photo crop to 604x600 in the hero and to 295x340 in a card. Icons need cleaning: each media icon component (4:5 Account, 4:4 Arrow_Left, 4:6 Arrow_Right, 4:7 Cart, 4:8 Check, 4:9 Chevron_Down, 4:10 Chevron_Right, 4:11 Close, 4:12 Filter, 4:13 Minus, 4:14 Plus, 4:15 More, 4:16 Search, 4:17 Sparkle, 4:18 Star, 4:19 Star_Half, 4:20 Tag, 4:21 Trash, 4:23 Verified) carries a white fill square at its bounds. I clone only the vector children into new local components sized 24x24 and offset each child by minus the parent's position, which drops the white background and keeps the #1A1A1F strokes; instances then recolor descendants to white on dark surfaces. Social and payment logos stay as direct instances because their multi-color artwork must stay unaltered, and #1A1A1F reads correctly on the #F0F0F0 footer.\n\nThe design decisions are mine to fix, so I set them now. Canvas 1440 wide, content 1240 with 100 side margins. Palette: ink #000000, icon #1A1A1F, secondary text #6B6B70, surface #F0F0F0, hero surface #F2F0F1, border #E6E6E6, discount #FF3333, rating #FFC633, verified #01AB31, white #FFFFFF. Radii 8/12/16/20/40 plus pill 999; the Text Field keeps its 62 radius. Type: display-xl 64/68, display-lg 48/52, display-md 40/44, display-sm 32/36 in Archivo Black; heading 24/28 SemiBold, body 16/22, body-sm 14/20, caption 12/16, price 28/32, nav 16 Medium in Plus Jakarta Sans.\n\nOrder of construction: workspace page with tokens and atom components (Button Primary, Secondary, Ghost, Disabled); then product card, review card, style tile, header, footer, newsletter; then 01_Home at x=0, 02_Category at 1600, 03_Product at 3200, 04_Cart at 4800, with the component library parked at y=-2600. Prototype links use node.reactions with ON_CLICK and NAVIGATE to destinationId. Home stack: announcement 42h, header 96h, hero 660h, brand strip 100h, New Arrivals and Top Selling as 4-card grids at 295 each with 20 gap, dress styles panel radius 40 with tiles 480/740 and 740/480, three reviews at 400x260, black newsletter panel 1240x180, footer. The arithmetic for the 4-up grid holds: (1240 − 60) / 4 = 295. Category uses a 300 filter panel and a 3x3 product grid at 296. Product splits 600 gallery against 600 details with 3 thumbs at 152. Cart pairs a bordered line-item container with a 505 order summary.\n\nNothing here waits on another result, so I move straight into the setup call rather than asking for anything.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":7450,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":30380,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7450}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"56961d50-3bcb-4622-86f3-37954ad7b584","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:46:32.808Z","thinking_duration_ms":172682}
