{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNjGpo5iwCpIpDdBxxZG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The screenshot coming back 1x1 at 1440x216 and at maxDimension 1100 and 1000 is the odd part: 1100 is below 1440, so scaling the long edge explains nothing, and the earlier 11:10 render at maxDimension 600 returned 298x425 correctly. Nodes far from the origin, with negative y, look like the common factor, and the component set 12:92 and the footer 12:134 both sit at negative y, so I treat 1x1 as a rendering bug rather than a real size. The practical move is to build the screens first at y=0 and screenshot the page and frames afterward, once they sit at normal positions.\n\nWhat I need next: build 01_Home and 02_Category, then Product and Cart, then prototypes, then screenshots. Home and Category write to the same file, so I keep them in one call and run the script sequentially inside it, and Product plus Cart go in a separate call afterward.\n\nFor the build itself, every frame is 1440 wide with 100px margins. Home runs announcement 44, header 96, hero 660, brand strip 800 to 896, then New Arrivals, Top Selling, Dress Style, Reviews, Newsletter, Footer. The 4-card row is 4*298+3*16=1240. Dress Style tiles are 610+20+610. Reviews are 3 cards of 400 with 20 gaps, which gives 1240.\n\nFor Category, 280 filter + 24 gap + 934 grid = 1238, so I set the filter instance padding to 14 each side to fit its fixed 252 content. The product grid is 3 columns of 298 with 20 gaps.\n\nProduct uses a 600 gallery, thumbs of 188 (3*188+32=596), a 600 details column, 6 review cards, and a 4-card related row. Cart is 700 of line items plus a 505 order summary. Card overrides find Name, Score, Price, Old, Discount, Rating Row, and swap the Rating instance to the right variant; rows without an old price get visible=false.\n\nI resize the footer component to 400 high since its inner content is 281 plus 60 top and bottom.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":6555,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":95730,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":6555}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"2a101733-a2fb-4ff6-9ca5-9d34e58fc262","timestamp":"2026-11-01T20:55:24.661Z","thinking_duration_ms":38648}
