{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNkaCsd6nrXxLEQqulG1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for a work-through of what comes next, and the main thing I need to settle is how the plan splits into independent calls. The state of play: icon ink sits at 2.7px inside 16px boxes from a rescaling bug, Filter Panel is 2162 tall from broken nested rows, Order Summary is 764 tall, and the icon heights are wrong (Minus h=0, More h=5, Chevron_Right h=32, Star_Half h=30). Screens 01 and 02 exist but render collapsed cards, dots for icons, and empty dress-style rows. The rebuild needs plain absolute positioning with no auto-layout in components, and all four screens rebuilt the same way.\n\nSo the ordering is: components first, then screens. Screens 03 and 04 depend on the component rebuild but not on screens 01 and 02, so all four screens build in one call after components. The prototype wiring depends on screens, and screenshots depend on frames. One read that stands apart is verifying assets and hashes.\n\nFor the icons, the issue is that cloning vectors plus resizing confuses coordinates, because the source icon components in 04 Media have children positioned relative to a parent group with different bounds. The fix is to build each icon component as a 24x24 wrapper (Star and Star_Half at 18, Sparkle at 40) containing an instance of the original media component, with that instance's fills set to empty to drop the white plate. Rescaling the instance by size/origWidth keeps the vector geometry exact, and recoloring sets the vector child fills.\n\nMy reliable path is to wipe the broken library and rebuild the business components (Product Card 298x430, Review Card 400x218, Cart Line Item, Filter Panel, Order Summary, Newsletter, Footer, Header, Breadcrumb, Brand Strip, Announcement) with absolute x/y, keeping the Button and Field sets since they render fine.\n\nI make the first request now: the full component rebuild as a single write call. Nothing else builds before it.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9448,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":216570,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9448}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"038c7a5f-5273-490b-952d-72936641d6d3","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:12:36.297Z","thinking_duration_ms":76805}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNkaCsd6nrXxLEQqulG1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately: what I need next is (1) a clean component rebuild, absolute-positioned, with icons re-derived from the media library instead of my broken clones; (2) Home and Category rebuilt on that base; (3) Product and Cart; (4) prototype wiring; (5) screenshot verification of all four screens. Items 2–5 all depend on 1, and 3 depends on the same components as 2, so the only thing that can run right now is the component rebuild. Requesting it alone."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9448,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":216570,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9448}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"94fbe727-bf09-4858-9336-ab94381efe0c","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:12:39.313Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNkaCsd6nrXxLEQqulG1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01OS7cSOg0eBtHfcFlhd1irO","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst ws = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.indexOf('03') === 0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst F = { display:{family:'Archivo Black',style:'Regular'}, reg:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'}, med:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Medium'}, semi:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'}, bold:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Bold'} };\nfor (const k in F) await figma.loadFontAsync(F[k]);\nconst C = { ink:'#000000', ink2:'#1A1A1F', body:'#5F5F66', muted:'#8A8A90', line:'#E4E4E7', surface:'#F0F0F0', warm:'#F2F0F1', discount:'#FF3333', discountBg:'#FFECEC', rating:'#FFC633', verified:'#01AB31', white:'#FFFFFF', empty:'#D9D9DE' };\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction paint(h,a){return {type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:a===undefined?1:a};}\n\n// ---- wipe old library children except Button/Field sets ----\nconst lib = ws.findOne(n=>n.name==='Components · Core');\nfor (const ch of lib.children.slice()) {\n  if (ch.type==='COMPONENT_SET' && (ch.name==='Button'||ch.name==='Field')) continue;\n  ch.remove();\n}\nlib.resize(3400,2200);\n\n// ---- absolute frame helper ----\nfunction box(parent,name,o){\n  o=o||{};\n  const n=figma.createFrame();\n  n.name=name;\n  n.fills=o.fill?[paint(o.fill)]:(o.fills||[]);\n  if(o.r!==undefined)n.cornerRadius=o.r;\n  if(o.stroke){n.strokes=[paint(o.stroke)];n.strokeWeight=o.sw===undefined?1:o.sw;n.strokeAlign='INSIDE';}\n  if(o.clip)n.clipsContent=true;\n  parent.appendChild(n);\n  n.resize(o.w===undefined?100:o.w,o.h===undefined?100:o.h);\n  n.x=o.x||0;n.y=o.y||0;\n  return n;\n}\nfunction comp(parent,name,w,h){\n  const n=figma.createComponent();\n  n.name=name;n.fills=[];parent.appendChild(n);n.resize(w,h);\n  return n;\n}\nfunction txt(parent,o){\n  const t=figma.createText();\n  t.fontName=o.font||F.reg;t.characters=o.text||'';\n  t.fontSize=o.size||16;\n  if(o.lh)t.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh};\n  t.fills=[paint(o.color||C.ink)];\n  if(o.strike)t.textDecoration='STRIKETHROUGH';\n  if(o.align)t.textAlignHorizontal=o.align;\n  parent.appendChild(t);\n  if(o.w){t.resize(o.w,t.height);t.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';}else t.textAutoResize='WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT';\n  t.x=o.x||0;t.y=o.y||0;\n  if(o.name)t.name=o.name;\n  return t;\n}\nfunction spread(parent,items,x0,x1){\n  const total=items.reduce((s,i)=>s+i.width,0);\n  const gap=(x1-x0-total)/Math.max(1,items.length-1);\n  let x=x0;\n  for(const i of items){i.x=x;i.y=(i.y||0);x+=i.width+gap;}\n}\n\n// ---- icons from media library ----\nconst MEDIA={Account:'4:5',Arrow_Left:'4:4',Arrow_Right:'4:6',Cart:'4:7',Check:'4:8',Chevron_Down:'4:9',Chevron_Right:'4:10',Close:'4:11',Filter:'4:12',Minus:'4:13',Plus:'4:14',More:'4:15',Search:'4:16',Sparkle:'4:17',Star:'4:18',Star_Half:'4:19',Tag:'4:20',Trash:'4:21',Verified:'4:23'};\nconst BOX={Star:18,Star_Half:18,Sparkle:40,Check:14,Chevron_Down:16,Chevron_Right:16,Minus:16,Plus:16,More:20,Verified:20};\nconst iconIndex={};\nconst iconReport=[];\nfor (const name of Object.keys(MEDIA)) {\n  const src=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(MEDIA[name]);\n  const b=BOX[name]||24;\n  const c=comp(lib,'Icon/'+name,b,b);\n  const inst=src.createInstance();\n  inst.fills=[];\n  c.appendChild(inst);\n  inst.x=0;inst.y=0;\n  try {\n    const k=(b*0.88)/Math.max(src.width,src.height);\n    inst.rescale(k);\n  } catch(e) {\n    const k=(b*0.88)/Math.max(inst.width,inst.height);\n    inst.children.slice().forEach(ch=>{ch.resize(ch.width*k,ch.height*k);ch.x*=k;ch.y*=k;});\n  }\n  inst.x=Math.round((b-inst.width)/2);\n  inst.y=Math.round((b-inst.height)/2);\n  inst.findAll(v=>v.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>{\n    v.fills=[paint(C.ink2)];\n    if(v.strokes&&v.strokes.length)v.strokes=[paint(C.ink2)];\n  });\n  iconIndex[name]=c;\n  c.x=40+((Object.keys(MEDIA).indexOf(name))%10)*110;\n  c.y=40+Math.floor(Object.keys(MEDIA).indexOf(name)/10)*90;\n  iconReport.push(name+'='+Math.round(inst.width)+'x'+Math.round(inst.height));\n}\nfunction icon(parent,name,size,color){\n  const c=iconIndex[name];\n  const i=c.createInstance();\n  if(size&&size!==c.width)i.rescale(size/c.width);\n  const col=color||C.ink2;\n  i.findAll(v=>v.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>{v.fills=[paint(col)];if(v.strokes&&v.strokes.length)v.strokes=[paint(col)];});\n  parent.appendChild(i);\n  i.x=0;i.y=0;\n  return i;\n}\nfunction starRow(parent,x,y,score,size,color){\n  const full=Math.floor(score), half=(score-full)>=0.5;\n  const step=(size||18)+6;\n  for(let i=0;i<5;i++){\n    let kind='Star', col=(size&&color)||C.rating;\n    if(i<full) col=color||C.rating;\n    else if(i===full&&half){kind='Star_Half';col=color||C.rating;}\n    else col=C.empty;\n    const s=icon(parent,kind,size||18,col);\n    s.x=x+i*step; s.y=y;\n  }\n  return 5*step-6;\n}\n\n// ---- Rating set ----\nconst ratingBox=box(lib,'Rating Holder',{w:1300,h:40,x:40,y:400});\nconst ratingVariants=[];\n[5,4.5,4,3.5,3].forEach((score,i)=>{\n  const c=comp(ratingBox,'Score='+score,130,18);\n  c.x=i*160;c.y=0;\n  starRow(c,0,0,score,18);\n  ratingVariants.push(c);\n});\nconst ratingSet=figma.combineAsVariants(ratingVariants,lib);\nratingSet.name='Rating';ratingSet.x=40;ratingSet.y=380;\nconst ratingByScore={};\nratingSet.children.forEach(c=>{ratingByScore[c.name.split('=')[1]]=c;});\n\n// ---- Product Card ----\nconst cardC=comp(lib,'Product Card',298,432);\nconst cardImg=box(cardC,'Image',{w:298,h:298,r:20,clip:true});\ncardImg.fills=[paint(C.warm)];\nconst cardName=txt(cardC,{text:'T-shirt with Tape Details',font:F.semi,size:20,lh:27,w:298,y:310,name:'Name'});\nconst cardRateRow=box(cardC,'Rating Row',{w:298,h:20,y:352});\nconst cardRating=ratingByScore['4.5'].createInstance();cardRateRow.appendChild(cardRating);cardRating.x=0;cardRating.y=1;cardRating.name='Rating';\ntxt(cardRateRow,{text:'4.5/5',font:F.reg,size:14,color:C.body,x:136,y:1,name:'Score'});\nconst cardPriceRow=box(cardC,'Price Row',{w:298,h:32,y:388});\ntxt(cardPriceRow,{text:'$120',font:F.bold,size:24,x:0,y:0,name:'Price'});\ntxt(cardPriceRow,{text:'$160',font:F.bold,size:24,color:'#B5B5BA',strike:true,x:76,y:0,name:'Old'});\nconst cardDisc=box(cardPriceRow,'Discount',{w:56,h:28,fill:C.discountBg,r:62,x:152,y:4});\ntxt(cardDisc,{text:'-30%',font:F.med,size:12,color:C.discount,x:8,y:6,name:'Disc'});\ncardC.x=40;cardC.y=480;\n\n// ---- Review Card ----\nconst revC=comp(lib,'Review Card',400,232);\nrevC.fills=[paint(C.white)];revC.cornerRadius=20;revC.strokes=[paint(C.line)];revC.strokeWeight=1;revC.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nstarRow(revC,32,30,5,20);\ntxt(revC,{text:'Sarah M.',font:F.bold,size:20,x:32,y:74,name:'Name'});\nconst revVer=icon(revC,'Verified',20,C.verified);revVer.x=80;revVer.y=78;\ntxt(revC,{text:'“I’m blown away by the quality and style of the clothes I received from Shop.co. From casual wear to elegant dresses, every piece I’ve bought has exceeded my expectations.”',font:F.reg,size:15,color:C.body,lh:22,w:336,x:32,y:112,name:'Quote'});\nrevC.x=380;revC.y=480;\n\n// ---- Cart Line Item ----\nconst lineC=comp(lib,'Cart Line Item',680,148);\nlineC.fills=[];lineC.clipsContent=false;\nconst lineImg=box(lineC,'Image',{w:108,h:108,r:12,clip:true});\nlineImg.fills=[paint(C.warm)];\ntxt(lineC,{text:'Gradient Graphic T-shirt',font:F.semi,size:18,x:124,y:6,name:'Name'});\ntxt(lineC,{text:'Size: Large',font:F.reg,size:14,color:C.body,x:124,y:36,name:'Size'});\ntxt(lineC,{text:'Color: White',font:F.reg,size:14,color:C.body,x:124,y:58,name:'Color'});\ntxt(lineC,{text:'$145',font:F.bold,size:20,x:124,y:88,name:'Price'});\nconst lineTrash=icon(lineC,'Trash',20,C.body);lineTrash.x=536;lineTrash.y=4;\nconst lineStepper=box(lineC,'Stepper',{w:110,h:38,fill:C.surface,r:62,x:446,y:96});\