{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNlBKKawCRN3cSShVtqF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to fix the product card images that render grey, the dress-style tile layering, the stray Shop nav dot, the heavy account and cart icons, then screenshot Product and Cart before wiring the prototype. I find the root cause of the grey cards: the Product Card component has a frame named 'Image' but no rectangle named 'Photo' inside it, so `i.findOne(n=>n.name==='Photo')` returns null and the image fill is silently skipped. The fix is to add a Photo rectangle to the Product Card component. The dress tile labels sit behind the photo, so the label needs to come after the photo in z-order. The nav dot is placed at 0,0, which puts it next to Shop as a stray dot.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":12881,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":266565,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12881}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"d93a050a-c577-4488-9b83-0c1369151628","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:19:11.902Z","thinking_duration_ms":19540}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNlBKKawCRN3cSShVtqF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining work: product-card photos render empty (the card component has no `Photo` layer, so my instance overrides silently did nothing), dress-tile labels sit behind their photos, the review-card verified mark overlaps the name, and I still haven't seen Product or Cart. Independently queued now: one write fixing the card, tile, and review components plus reapplying image fills, and read-only screenshots of Product and Cart, which already exist and don't depend on that fix."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":12881,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":266565,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12881}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"914f4ebc-4f80-4ea7-a3ca-543690192dac","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:19:14.752Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNlBKKawCRN3cSShVtqF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01xSZI0srARHlIc93lfIPah0","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst ws = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.indexOf('03') === 0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst F = { display:{family:'Archivo Black',style:'Regular'}, reg:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'}, med:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Medium'}, semi:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'}, bold:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Bold'} };\nfor (const k in F) await figma.loadFontAsync(F[k]);\nconst C = { ink:'#000000', ink2:'#1A1A1F', body:'#5F5F66', muted:'#8A8A90', line:'#E4E4E7', surface:'#F0F0F0', warm:'#F2F0F1', discount:'#FF3333', discountBg:'#FFECEC', rating:'#FFC633', verified:'#01AB31', white:'#FFFFFF' };\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction paint(h,a){return {type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:a===undefined?1:a};}\nfunction imgFill(hash){return [{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:hash,scaleMode:'FILL'}];}\n\n// ---- 1) add Photo rectangle to Product Card component ----\nconst card=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Product Card');\nlet cardImg=card.findOne(n=>n.name==='Image');\nif(!cardImg){ throw new Error('card Image missing'); }\nlet photo=card.findOne(n=>n.name==='Photo');\nconst tape=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('4:48')).fills[0].imageHash;\nif(!photo){\n  photo=figma.createRectangle(); photo.name='Photo'; cardImg.appendChild(photo); photo.resize(298,298); photo.x=0; photo.y=0;\n}\nphoto.fills=imgFill(tape);\n\n// ---- 2) Review Card: name width + verified after text ----\nconst rev=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Review Card');\nconst nm=rev.findOne(n=>n.name==='Name');\nconst ver=rev.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name==='Icon/Verified')[0];\nif(nm&&ver){ ver.x=nm.x+nm.width+8; }\n\n// ---- 3) Product Review Card: verified after reviewer ----\nconst prc=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Product Review Card');\nconst rv=prc.findOne(n=>n.name==='Reviewer');\nconst rvVer=prc.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name==='Icon/Verified')[0];\nif(rv&&rvVer){ rvVer.x=rv.x+rv.width+8; }\n\n// ---- 4) refill images on every card instance in all frames ----\nconst HID={};\nfor (const [k,id] of Object.entries({Hero:'4:36',Casual:'4:44',Formal:'4:45',Party:'4:47',Gym:'4:46',One1:'4:38',One2:'4:39',One3:'4:50',Gradient:'4:35',PoloTip:'4:41',BlackStripe:'4:32',PoloContrast:'4:40',Check:'4:33',Jeans:'4:42',Tape:'4:48',Sleeve:'4:43',Vertical:'4:51',Courage:'4:49',Bermuda:'4:37',Faded:'4:34'})) { const n=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id); HID[k]=n.fills[0].imageHash; }\nconst nameToHash={\n 'T-shirt with Tape Details':HID.Tape,'Skinny Fit Jeans':HID.Jeans,'Checkered Shirt':HID.Check,'Sleeve Striped T-shirt':HID.Sleeve,\n 'Vertical Striped Shirt':HID.Vertical,'Courage Graphic T-shirt':HID.Courage,'Loose Fit Bermuda Shorts':HID.Bermuda,'Faded Skinny Jeans':HID.Faded,\n 'Gradient Graphic T-shirt':HID.Gradient,'Polo with Tipping Details':HID.PoloTip,'Black Striped T-shirt':HID.BlackStripe,'Polo with Contrast Trims':HID.PoloContrast\n};\nlet filled=0;\nfor (const inst of ws.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Card · ')===0)) {\n  const nmT=inst.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.name==='Name')[0];\n  const key=nmT?nmT.characters.replace(/^Card · /,''):'';\n  const hash=nameToHash[key];\n  const ph=inst.findOne(n=>n.name==='Photo');\n  if(ph&&hash){ ph.fills=imgFill(hash); filled++; }\n}\n\n// ---- 5) dress tiles: bring label above photo ----\nfor (const tile of ws.findAll(n=>n.name&&n.name.indexOf('Tile ')===0&&n.type==='FRAME')) {\n  const label=tile.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT');\n  if(label){ tile.appendChild(label); label.x=32; label.y=24; }\n}\n\n// ---- 6) header current dot: hide stray dots ----\nfor (const hdr of ws.findAll(n=>n.name==='Header'&&n.type==='INSTANCE')) {\n  hdr.findAll(n=>n.name==='Current Dot').forEach(d=>{d.visible=false;});\n}\nconst hdrSet=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT_SET'&&n.name==='Header');\nif(hdrSet) hdrSet.findAll(n=>n.name==='Current Dot').forEach((d,i)=>{ d.x=8; d.y=100; d.visible=false; });\n\n// ---- 7) cart line item images ----\nfor (const li of ws.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name&&n.name.indexOf('Line · ')===0)) {\n  const nmT=li.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.name==='Name')[0];\n  const key=nmT?nmT.characters:'';\n  const hash=nameToHash[key];\n  const ph=li.findOne(n=>n.name==='Photo');\n  if(ph&&hash) ph.fills=imgFill(hash);\n}\n\nreturn {filled, card:card.id, photo:photo.id};\n","description":"Add Photo layer to card, refill all card and cart images, fix label stacking","fileKey":"fpL5izeAHRNlVGSdWNFooV"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":12881,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":266565,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":12881}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"78f515ed-f792-452f-8aa4-0240a5b07110","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:19:27.644Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01xSZI0srARHlIc93lfIPah0","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
