{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNlFxIUeKqC2UoWlp44U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to continue the front-end build work across the Home, Category, Product and Cart screens. I have four fixes and one wiring pass to carry out.\n\nFirst, the cart line-item thumbnails sit empty because the Cart Line Item component has no \"Photo\" rectangle; the refill loop found the matching name but had no photo node to paint. So I add a Photo rectangle to Cart Line Item at the same offsets used on the product cards, then refill the cart images from nameToHash for \"Gradient Graphic T-shirt\" and the other line items.\n\nSecond, two icons render wrong: Icon/Account shows as a solid black dot in the cart header and Icon/Verified shows as a small green dot beside reviewer names, while Icon/Close in the announce bar also collapses to a dot. Also the star and arrow icons looked fine, so the fault is in how these specific components were assembled, not in the rescale helper. I fix each by removing the broken inner instance and placing a fresh instance of the source media component, with the white plate removed, rescaled from the 24px natural size to the target (24 for Account, 20 for Verified, 20 for Close), centered, and recolored to ink.\n\nThird, on the Product page the tab row sits at y=1000 while the thumbnails end at 1004, so \"Product Details\" overlaps the gallery. I shift every child at y>=1000 down by 60 and grow the frame height from 3300 to 3360.\n\nFourth, prototype wiring. I set ON_CLICK reactions with NODE navigation: Home product cards and the Casual tile (at 164,2542, 546x290) go to Product; Shop Now and both View All buttons go to Category; breadcrumbs go Home or Category; Add to Cart on Product goes to Cart; cart line items go back to Product. Because the cart glyph lives inside the Header instance and instance children cannot hold reactions, I place transparent 40x40 hotspot rectangles at x=1280, y=76 on each screen for the cart, and 60x28 hotspots at (100,158) for the Home breadcrumb crumb.\n\nAll of this is sequential work on one file, so it runs in a single call, and I take fresh screenshots of Product, Cart and Home afterwards to confirm the images, icons and tab spacing.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9005,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":279446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9005}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"5ca22b72-16a1-4e0a-9002-be9f40f582bc","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:20:48.054Z","thinking_duration_ms":58891}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNlFxIUeKqC2UoWlp44U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I write anything: what I need next is (1) add a `Photo` layer to the Cart Line Item component and refill cart thumbnails, (2) repair the broken `Icon/Account`, `Icon/Verified` and `Icon/Close` (they render as dots), (3) shift the Product page's tabs/reviews block down so it no longer collides with the thumbnail row, (4) wire the required prototype interactions with click hotspots, (5) final screenshot verification of all four screens. Items 1–4 all mutate the same file, so they must run in one sequential write; item 5 depends on that write and cannot run in parallel. Requesting the single combined write now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9005,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":279446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9005}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"af62f039-77df-46d5-8910-2885073cfce0","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:20:51.786Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgNlFxIUeKqC2UoWlp44U","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01xXVYWGCdvzbMXYRdZooODj","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst ws = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.indexOf('03') === 0);\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst F = { display:{family:'Archivo Black',style:'Regular'}, reg:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Regular'}, med:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Medium'}, semi:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'SemiBold'}, bold:{family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',style:'Bold'} };\nfor (const k in F) await figma.loadFontAsync(F[k]);\nconst C = { ink:'#000000', ink2:'#1A1A1F', line:'#E4E4E7', warm:'#F2F0F1' };\nfunction hx(h){h=h.replace('#','');return {r:parseInt(h.slice(0,2),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(2,4),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(4,6),16)/255};}\nfunction paint(h,a){return {type:'SOLID',color:hx(h),opacity:a===undefined?1:a};}\nconst log={};\n\n// ---------- 1) Cart Line Item: add Photo rectangle ----------\nconst line=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Cart Line Item');\nconst lineImg=line.findOne(n=>n.name==='Image');\nlet linePhoto=line.findOne(n=>n.name==='Photo');\nif(!linePhoto){\n  linePhoto=figma.createRectangle(); linePhoto.name='Photo';\n  lineImg.appendChild(linePhoto); linePhoto.resize(108,108); linePhoto.x=0; linePhoto.y=0;\n}\nlog.linePhoto=linePhoto.id;\n\n// ---------- 2) repair icons that render as dots ----------\nconst MEDIA_ICONS={Account:['4:5',24],Verified:['4:23',20],Close:['4:11',20]};\nconst iconFix=[];\nfor (const name of Object.keys(MEDIA_ICONS)) {\n  const [srcId, target] = MEDIA_ICONS[name];\n  const c=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='COMPONENT'&&n.name==='Icon/'+name);\n  if(!c) continue;\n  c.children.slice().forEach(ch=>ch.remove());\n  const src=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(srcId);\n  const inst=src.createInstance();\n  inst.fills=[];\n  c.appendChild(inst);\n  const k=target/Math.max(src.width,src.height);\n  try{ inst.rescale(k); }catch(e){}\n  inst.x=Math.round((c.width-inst.width)/2);\n  inst.y=Math.round((c.height-inst.height)/2);\n  inst.findAll(v=>v.type==='VECTOR').forEach(v=>{\n    v.fills=[paint(C.ink2)];\n    if(v.strokes&&v.strokes.length)v.strokes=[paint(C.ink2)];\n  });\n  iconFix.push(name+' box='+Math.round(c.width)+'x'+Math.round(c.height)+' ink='+Math.round(inst.width)+'x'+Math.round(inst.height));\n}\nlog.icons=iconFix;\n\n// ---------- 3) Product page vertical rhythm: shift everything below thumbs ----------\nconst prod=ws.findOne(n=>n.type==='FRAME'&&n.name==='03_Product');\nlet shifted=0;\nif(prod){\n  for (const ch of prod.children) {\n    if (ch.y>=990) { ch.y=ch.y+70; shifted++; }\n  }\n  prod.resize(1440,3370);\n}\nlog.shifted=shifted;\n\n// ---------- 4) refill cart line thumbnails + product cards ----------\nconst HID={};\nfor (const [k,id] of Object.entries({Gradient:'4:35',Check:'4:33',Jeans:'4:42',Tape:'4:48',Sleeve:'4:43',Vertical:'4:51',Courage:'4:49',Bermuda:'4:37',Faded:'4:34',PoloTip:'4:41',BlackStripe:'4:32',PoloContrast:'4:40'})) { const n=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id); HID[k]=n.fills[0].imageHash; }\nconst nameToHash={\n 'T-shirt with Tape Details':HID.Tape,'Skinny Fit Jeans':HID.Jeans,'Checkered Shirt':HID.Check,'Sleeve Striped T-shirt':HID.Sleeve,\n 'Vertical Striped Shirt':HID.Vertical,'Courage Graphic T-shirt':HID.Courage,'Loose Fit Bermuda Shorts':HID.Bermuda,'Faded Skinny Jeans':HID.Faded,\n 'Gradient Graphic T-shirt':HID.Gradient,'Polo with Tipping Details':HID.PoloTip,'Black Striped T-shirt':HID.BlackStripe,'Polo with Contrast Trims':HID.PoloContrast\n};\nlet cartFilled=0;\nfor (const li of ws.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Line · ')===0)) {\n  const nm=li.findAll(n=>n.type==='TEXT'&&n.name==='Name')[0];\n  const hash=nm?nameToHash[nm.characters]:null;\n  const ph=li.findOne(n=>n.name==='Photo');\n  if(ph&&hash){ ph.fills=[{type:'IMAGE',imageHash:hash,scaleMode:'FILL'}]; cartFilled++; }\n}\nlog.cartFilled=cartFilled;\n\n// ---------- 5) prototype wiring ----------\nconst frames={};\nws.children.filter(n=>n.type==='FRAME').forEach(f=>frames[f.name]=f);\nconst home=frames['01_Home'], cat=frames['02_Category'], product=frames['03_Product'], cart=frames['04_Cart'];\nfunction react(node,dest){\n  if(!node||!dest) return false;\n  node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},action:{type:'NODE',navigation:'NAVIGATE',destinationId:dest.id,transition:null,preserveScrollPosition:false}}];\n  return true;\n}\nfunction hotspot(parent,x,y,w,h,name){\n  const r=figma.createRectangle();\n  r.name=name||'Hotspot';\n  r.resize(w,h); r.x=x; r.y=y;\n  r.fills=[paint('#FFFFFF',0.001)];\n  parent.appendChild(r);\n  return r;\n}\nlet links=0;\n// HOME\nif(home){\n  home.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Card · ')===0).forEach(c=>{ if(react(c,product)) links++; });\n  for (const ch of home.children) {\n    if (ch.type==='INSTANCE'&&ch.name==='Type=Primary'){ if(react(ch,cat)) links++; }\n    if (ch.type==='INSTANCE'&&ch.name==='Type=Secondary'){ if(react(ch,cat)) links++; }\n  }\n  const casual=hotspot(home,164,2542,546,290,'Hotspot · Casual Tile'); if(react(casual,cat)) links++;\n  const cartHit=hotspot(home,1276,96,44,44,'Hotspot · Header Cart'); if(react(cartHit,cart)) links++;\n}\n// CATEGORY\nif(cat){\n  cat.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Card · ')===0).forEach(c=>{ if(react(c,product)) links++; });\n  const cHome=hotspot(cat,100,156,60,30,'Hotspot · Breadcrumb Home'); if(react(cHome,home)) links++;\n  const cCart=hotspot(cat,1276,96,44,44,'Hotspot · Header Cart'); if(react(cCart,cart)) links++;\n}\n// PRODUCT\nif(product){\n  product.findAll(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.name.indexOf('Card · ')===0).forEach(c=>{ if(react(c,product)) links++; });\n  for (const ch of product.children) {\n    if (ch.type==='INSTANCE'&&ch.name==='Type=Primary'&&ch.y>700&&ch.y<900){ if(react(ch,cart)) links++; }\n  }\n  const pShop=hotspot(product,100,156,60,30,'Hotspot · Breadcrumb Shop'); if(react(pShop,cat)) links++;\n  const pCart=hotspot(product,1276,96,44,44,'Hotspot · Header Cart'); if(react(pCart,cart)) links++;\n}\n// CART\nif(cart){\n  const cHome=hotspot(cart,100,156,60,30,'Hotspot · Breadcrumb Home'); if(react(cHome,home)) links++;\n  const itemHit=hotspot(cart,100,300,715,140,'Hotspot · Cart Item'); if(react(itemHit,product)) links++;\n  const cartCart=hotspot(cart,1276,96,44,44,'Hotspot · Header Cart'); if(react(cartCart,cart)) links++;\n}\nlog.links=links;\nlog.frameIds={home:home&&home.id,cat:cat&&cat.id,product:product&&product.id,cart:cart&&cart.id};\nreturn log;\n","description":"Fix cart photos and dot icons, shift product sections, wire prototype hotspots","fileKey":"fpL5izeAHRNlVGSdWNFooV"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9005,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":279446,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9005}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7c5d4f2f-9471-4ee4-b741-5d1ccd75321e","uuid":"ef0e4515-5c68-4c65-861a-f934e9dc9ad6","timestamp":"2026-11-01T21:21:10.956Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01xXVYWGCdvzbMXYRdZooODj","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
